[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ノーヴァ神聖国・広場",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nova Sacred Nation - Plaza"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "",
        "localizations": {
          "en": ""
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヴィクトルたちにまで手伝わせちゃって悪いわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry for making you and Viktor help out with this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これは僕たちの問題でもある。それに、\n借りたものは返却するまでが大切だからね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is our problem too. Besides, properly returning what you borrow is important."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そもそも大切な資料だし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They are valuable documents, after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "調子に乗って、たくさん借りすぎちゃったけどね〜",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Though we might've gotten carried away and borrowed a bit too many..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ。神官長様だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh. It's His Eminence."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、星の導きによって新たな掟とされるのですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So this will become new law through the stars' guidance?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "歌姫",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Songstress"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。街の者たちには、新たに作成した\nブレスレットを着用してもらいます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. The townspeople will be required to wear the new bracelets we're creating."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今は調査団で完成を急がせているところ。\nじきに運び込まれて来るでしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The investigation team is rushing to complete them now. They should be delivered soon."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかし義務ですか。徹底させるのは\n骨が折れそうですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But making it mandatory? That might be difficult to enforce."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "星のご加護のためなのです。正しく導きましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is for the stars' protection. We must guide them properly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "神官長",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "High Priest"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほへぇ。星のご加護かぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh. The stars' protection..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "新しい決まりが増えるみたいね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like we're getting new regulations."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも……なんだか変な話な気がする。\n街の人全員にブレスレットを付けさせるなんて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But... something feels off about this. Making everyone in town wear bracelets?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん？\u3000僕たち調査団が付けている\nこのバンダナみたいなものじゃないか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm? Isn't it like these red bandanas we wear in the investigation team?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういうものなんでしょうか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is it really the same thing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（ブレスレットか……ちょっと気になるけど）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Bracelets... that's concerning...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とにかく今は本を返して、アトリエに戻ろうよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Anyway, let's return these books and head back to the atelier!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]